## Test Data Management

### Canonical Test Data
**Location:** Document test data patterns in a separate reference file
**Principle:** Use consistent, repeatable test data across all tests

### Test Data Organization
```
tests/
├── fixtures/           # Shared test data
├── mocks/             # Mock objects and responses
└── data/              # Test datasets
```

### Data Isolation
- Each test should be independent
- Use setup/teardown for data management
- Clean up after tests to avoid pollution

---

## Artifact Management

### Standard Artifact Structure
```
Workspaces/TEMP/
├── test-artifacts/       # Screenshots, traces, videos
├── test-report/         # Test execution reports
├── test-results/        # Test result files (XML, JSON, etc.)
└── test-coverage/       # Code coverage reports
```

### Artifact Retention Policy
- **Success:** Minimal artifacts (basic logs only)
- **Failure:** Full artifacts (screenshots, traces, videos, logs)
- **CI/CD:** Configure artifact upload for failed tests

